OL,4,CTiny cars taking off in Europe       W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GSelena Buse, 16, reverses her        W5
OL,7,GCitroen Ami out of a parking space   W5
OL,8,Gand heads off past the school        W5
OL,9,Gplayground. Heads turn. The Ami      W5
OL,10,Glooks pretty remarkable. Futurist or W5
OL,11,Glike-a-toaster depending on your     W5
OL,12,Gpoint of view. But it's changed her  W5
OL,13,Glife.                                W5
OL,14,                                      W5
OL,15,G"I got it because I really needed it W5
OL,16,Gto get to school. And I use it to    W5
OL,17,Gvisit friends on the weekends. It's  W5
OL,18,Gindispensable in rural areas like    W5
OL,19,Gwhere I live," she says.             W5
